      <section id="description-section" class="product-anchor-section">
        <h1>Product Details</h1>
        <div>
          <p>Upgrade your workshop and unlock the full potential of your welding table. 
      &nbsp;<b>The dWTA01 Kit</b>&nbsp;is the official technical documentation for professional tooling that 
      you’ve seen in action on the Mateusz Doniec channel. This system is designed to ensure 
      repeatability, perfect angles, and rapid part setup. The project was created by 
      combining Mateusz's workshop practice with the&nbsp;<b>engineering expertise of a technologist with 20 years of experience</b>&nbsp;in steel construction design.</p>
      
            <h3>What exactly is included in the dWTA02 package?</h3>
            <p>By purchasing this product, you receive a complete set of digital documentation (DXF and PDF files) for the following components:</p>

          <ul class="dots">
     <li>
         <p><b>Comprehensive square set:&nbsp;</b>Plans for flat squares, 3D weldable versions, and squares in the following dimensions: 175x85, 175x125, and 175x175.</p>
    </li>
      <li>
         <p><b>Universal stops and spacers:&nbsp;</b>Documentation for precision stops and spacers for rapid part positioning.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
         <p><b>Eccentric discs:&nbsp;</b>Plans for discs in two diameter variants: Ø75 and Ø100.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
         <p><b>Base elements and extensions:&nbsp;</b>Documentation for a 1000mm weldable extension and a flat protractor.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
         <p><b>Workshop organization:&nbsp;</b>Plans for practical pin shelves and clamp racks to be mounted directly on the table.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
         <p><b>Additional modules:&nbsp;</b>Plans for weldable bases in sizes: 350x250, 500x250, 600x250, and 750x250.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
            

         <h3>What’s included in this project?</h3>

          <ul class="dots">
            <li>
              <p><b>Precision DXF files:&nbsp;</b>Ready for laser cutting, optimized for minimal steel waste.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p><b>Detailed assembly instructions (PDF):&nbsp;</b>A step-by-step guide on how to assemble and prepare the accessories for work.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p><b>Full material list:&nbsp;</b>A detailed breakdown of plate thicknesses and steel grades for the entire kit.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p><b>Technical documentation and 3D views:&nbsp;</b>Clear assembly drawings for easy fabrication.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Why choose this kit?</h3>

          <ul class="dots">
            <li>
              <p><b>Full compatibility:&nbsp;</b>Project exclusively tailored for the professional 28 / 16 mm hole system.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p><b>Fraction of market cost:&nbsp;</b>Building these tools yourself saves thousands compared to off-the-shelf products.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p><b>Field-tested project:&nbsp;</b>Every element has been proven to "get the job done" in Mateusz Doniec's workshop.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="product-note">
  <p class="product-note__title">ℹ️ Digital Product (DIY Plans)</p>
  <p>This purchase includes only digital build plans and helper files (DXF/PDF) for self-assembly. This is NOT a physical product. Completing the project requires your own materials, tools, and appropriate skills.</p>
</div>
